# HAMultiHost Flow Diagram

## Overview
HAMultiHost manages multiple server URLs for high availability and load balancing.

## Flow Diagram

```plantuml
@startuml HAMultiHost_Flow
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam activity {
    BackgroundColor LightBlue
    BorderColor DarkBlue
    FontColor Black
}

start

:Start HAMultiHost;
:Constructor with Parameters;

:Call init() method;

partition "Initialization Phase" {
    :Initialize Host Configurations;
    :Parse URL String;
    :Split by comma;
    :Create URL objects;
    :Create HostConfiguration for each URL;
    :Store in allHostConfigurationMap;
}

:Start ConnectionChecker Thread;

partition "Monitoring Phase" {
